**Targets:** WCAG AA does not require every button to be 44×44. That is **2.5.5 Target Size (Enhanced), AAA**. For your stated AA target, 2.5.8's 24×24 rule and exceptions are the conformance test. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="28"}

**Checkout-specific blind spot:** these four fixes do not establish overall AA conformance. Because checkout normally culminates in a financial transaction, also verify **3.3.4 Error Prevention (Legal, Financial, Data), AA**: the transaction must be reversible, checked for errors with correction opportunity, or reviewable/confirmable before final submission. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="29"} [WCAG 2.2 normative specification](https://www.w3.org/TR/wcag/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

