There is **no basis in the facts provided to tell your team “you must switch all update signatures by date X.”** FIPS 204 itself says its mandatory applicability concerns specified U.S. federal systems and that adoption is available to private/commercial organizations. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="12"} Your contractual, sectoral, governmental, or certification obligations could change that answer, but you have not supplied them.

